# What this module needs on the machine, name | kind | locator | policy | consumer | reason.
# The format and the kinds are documented in the repository root CLAUDE.md. This file names
# tools and never how to install one, since that mapping is DEPENDENCIES.map one layer up.
# Written by hand, because this module has no sub units to fold declarations from.
nvim     | path      | nvim                   | required | nvim   | the editor this entire module configures
git      | path      | git                    | required | lazy   | the plugin manager clones every plugin with it
ripgrep  | path      | rg                     | required | lazyvim | the grep pickers, which are core to this distribution
fd       | path      | fd                     | required | lazyvim | the file pickers
cc       | system    | /usr/bin/cc            | required | treesitter | compiling a treesitter parser, and parsers install on first open
lazygit  | path      | lazygit                | optional | lazyvim | the git popup binding
